---
title: "initializePublishSaleResults (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: validate caller is Legion operator
    q_check_caller --> q_check_timing: block.timestamp > refundEndTime
    q_check_timing --> q_check_not_canceled: auction not canceled
    q_check_not_canceled --> q_lock: cancelLocked = true
    q_lock --> [*]: emit SaleResultsInitialized event

    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized caller
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: refund period not ended
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodNotEnded
    q_check_not_canceled --> q_revert_canceled: auction is canceled
    q_revert_canceled --> [*]: revert AuctionCanceled

    note right of q_lock
        INV-001: cancelLocked becomes true and cannot revert to false
        INV-002: cancel() is permanently disabled after this call
        INV-003: only callable after refundEndTime has passed
    end note
